{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "6de25ba2d450dca2518b5f9dce1faa9423e6d400c116ab58b7d29abb32808343", "ja": "あんまり恥ずかしかったから、実家から持って\nきちゃったんだけど……バッグに入れたままだった。", "zh": "实在太难为情了，就从老家带过来了\n不过……还一直放在包里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "fc5177cc57a42ae12dd8638af40d668460ce01b6b5a2ab5d9706ca6cb47fa50d", "ja": "万が一誰かに見られたら、恥ずかしすぎる……！\n何としてでも、持って帰らなくちゃ！", "zh": "万一被谁看到了，实在太丢人了……！\n无论如何都必须带回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2086f27d5a1d62e47d06c821b37974c18693c0c76266c23e79bb4a41b8672d0e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "a4882c767c098172aa2aebbb88cd75068235098658360a65ceb2b0b843548a21", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです{$P$}さん！\nよかった、しまった後で……。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了{$P$}先生！  \n太好了，幸好是在收起来之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "d8afec51c81ded2e852ea055cad9b774113dadf28c20c88bc72a8c329e4ba090", "ja": "あ、あの！　社長さんから伝言で、\n事務所に来てほしいそうですよ！", "zh": "啊，那个！社长让我转告您，\n他说希望您能来一趟事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d7fd0eba700135ac313da950dd3c9d7c9156faf1cc418eb7206702c6ca3cf104", "ja": "そうですか。『STARDOM ROAD』の件かな……\nわかりました、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "这样啊。是关于《STARDOM ROAD》的事吗……  \n我知道了，谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d7d7698d4bbdeb3e34d5a93614a1950b0dea5d53e46a0237fb9bec690815945b", "ja": "そうだ、お願いしていたファンレターと\nメールの整理、もう終わってますか？", "zh": "对了，之前拜托你整理的粉丝来信和邮件，已经整理完了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "8ce082458e37a7ff6f642d5817994ef1365847ad5c2ff061e3ec8eebcf296bd2", "ja": "あっ、はい！　もう終わったので、\nいつものところに置いてありますよ！", "zh": "啊，是的！已经整理完了，放在平时的地方了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d775dc4c496e86490682a24b954fbd265d5d7221228c0e262be0277333661d39", "ja": "助かります！　流石に量が多くて、\n自分一人でさばけなくて……。", "zh": "帮大忙了！实在是数量太多，靠我一个人处理不过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "5f47d776931c756db9dd86a6fe84a838ead39cd47f2be32541c554ce9185c37d", "ja": "いえいえ。『STARDOM ROAD』公演、\nファンの人達の熱い気持ちが伝わってきますよね。", "zh": "不用客气。“STARDOM ROAD”公演，\n能真切感受到粉丝们热烈的心意呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "421a6732a8ad66a8dd5b4ae03e5b54a08f9faac89532f689a0ede9972ce9bd96", "ja": "そうなんです。メールだけじゃなく、\n手書きの手紙も多くて……。", "zh": "就是这样。不仅是邮件，手写的信也有很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0b543a3f28080cd80e32a8c827f17b5b0c14cf3c75510b14c4114013ae41a4d8", "ja": "ファンの人が、気持ちを伝えたくて書いたものですし。\nしっかり受け取って、みんなに伝えてあげないと。", "zh": "这是粉丝们想要传达心意而写下的信件。\n我得好好收下，再替他们传达给大家才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "8fb6fb59f3ec60b7e78739c1a68cda4ab6a64386697ed3ba63704d87bbb5e775", "ja": "気持ちを伝えたくて、書いたもの……\nそう、ですよね。", "zh": "这是粉丝们为了传达心意而写下的东西……\n是、是这样没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3df8611f9b738585346f0626f7df1ef87a4c6090948ec63889c4f654ec6ad9b2", "ja": "では、自分は事務所に向かおうと思います。\nいってきますね！", "zh": "那么，我就先去事务所了。\n我出门啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "8756970ad9a8b925f71bb9df2704122105ea4e6935b4f053204a87662ec75986", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃ～い！\n……小さい頃の私が、伝えたかった気持ち……。", "zh": "好的，路上小心～！\n……小时候的我，想要传达的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "daad79ca8208978805f5c80d79a90a3b440fce00521c320c1925150c493e644b", "ja": "……うん。\n私も、捨てないで取っておこうかな。", "zh": "……嗯。\n我也留着不扔掉了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1017_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "50c0736488a1bf2e39b44d485d94fc9d1537682dc48f2b176154ac55eb1829e2", "ja": "劇場のアイドル39人が繋いでいく物語、\n『STARDOM ROAD』公演も第八幕……。", "zh": "由剧场的偶像39人共同串联而成的故事，《STARDOM ROAD》公演也来到第八幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "0e9378b4b4b2d450e54cc769bc1876f43f101ec3c5ae71cc0c8c2cace4f776a6", "ja": "第七幕から波乱は続く。ドラマも重くなり、\n期待もより大きくなっていくが……。", "zh": "从第七幕开始，风波仍将持续。剧情也会变得更加沉重，期待也会越来越高，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d2e560b822575c41e38a3cc60300696cddf40b15d66b49c626f0d79447a67e1f", "ja": "はい、覚悟はできています。このロングラン公演も\n終盤戦ですが、やる事は変わりません。", "zh": "是的，我已经做好觉悟了。虽然这场长期公演已进入尾声，但该做的事不会改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4424dd18b44ac76b8fd62da9745b1d93cf3da54ee0cd9aa286c72303b5a17a14", "ja": "自分の全力を、アイドルのみんなと一緒に\n精一杯出し切ります。それだけです。", "zh": "我会和偶像们一起，竭尽全力发挥出自己的全部实力。仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "2e5d5896587b385a4aa665fa2b0a3a33406887172b8e4526a0a6c520d06c3a1a", "ja": "うむ！　その言葉が聞けてよかった。", "zh": "嗯！能听到你这么说真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "fab520c570b1b20608fc4e25fcac895d424f9e21082eac7fad5e52e39879a2b5", "ja": "前回は、真珠星ちゃんのお母さんが神宮寺さんだと\n判明しての幕引きでしたけど……。", "zh": "上回的结尾是，揭晓了真珠星小姐的母亲就是神宫寺小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "9431656269f10f4b33ae7266c65e92f985b0a6bf22286992bf191efe0c08e203", "ja": "今回の過去編で、更に明かされる内容が……！\nああっ、この先は私の口からはとてもっ！", "zh": "在这次的过去篇中，还会揭晓更多内容……！\n啊啊，这之后的内容，我实在不能亲口说出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "9e36437453ed893d8886c7f9c13e6eaa833d77d16ac034e2419f4ceefbc07e27", "ja": "物語のほとんどの謎が明かされる回ですからね。\n前回以上に、強烈なんじゃないかと。", "zh": "毕竟这一回会揭开故事中几乎所有的谜团。\n我觉得会比上一回更加震撼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "64a089c0d7d2cbbf2f1ec4db6af19617f14bebd02f6f3bee91a7aab419ee026e", "ja": "最終幕に向けて、物語は加速……\nいよいよクライマックスに繋がります。", "zh": "故事正朝着终幕加速……\n终于要迎来最高潮了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "40dc29b17c0f1eef6590b2c5a9843382ed8b3f275e7c1a2f93f6204a9727c922", "ja": "しっかり、最後のバトンを繋ごうと思います！", "zh": "我会稳稳地接好最后一棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "cfc889fe9e7384c059ba9b460f93eab0c90337b96c046709f4ddaa22c1be1342", "ja": "うむ。やはり、君でなければここまで\n到達することは難しかったかもしれないね……。", "zh": "嗯。果然，如果不是你的话，\n想要达到这里恐怕是很难的呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "3d824989f9965fe7e288106490f153a7d1da54b6fc822ec6f7b1a064e7072693", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』最終幕へのバトン、\n君とアイドル諸君で繋げてくれたまえ！", "zh": "通往『STARDOM ROAD』最终幕的接力棒，\n就请你和各位偶像一同传承下去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
